      "content": "okay cool. wait, i literally just saw a news snippet about an Aether patent (US-9928412) that talks about \"conductive phase-change materials in miniaturized electronics.\" i thought that sounded almost exactly like our core process for the module. can you double check that specific patent number for me? i just want to be absolutely sure we aren't overlooking something that could blow up the funding later. if there's even a tiny overlap, i need to know now.",
